# Pikafish's official jieqi NNUE branch with ChanceMix (default on).
# Source: https://github.com/brianhliou/pikafish-jieqi-wasm/tree/jieqi-mistboard
# The 256-wide embedded net was trained from random initialization on jqe labels.
# It contains no Pikafish weights and is MIT licensed (src/jieqi-net-LICENSE).
# Embedded net: src/jieqi-b395f77e3ee9.nnue.zst; native default bench: 469838 nodes.
# Decided 2026-11-13 (#1104): replaces the classical jieqi_old build.
# 400 games, 4 s/move, 4 threads, Hash 256: 292 wins, 61 losses, 47 draws,
# +248 Elo [+213, +287] (pentanomial) against the previous Level 8 build.
#
# scripts/engine-assets.sh copies src/pikafish to bin/pikafish-jieqi.
# Python 3 embeds the checked-in net at build time; no net download is needed.
# Move PIKAFISH_JIEQI_ENGINE_REF and both engine versions with this pin: every
# evaluation can change. jieqi-engine-ref.test.ts guards the analysis cache keys.
# Browser artifacts and corresponding source live in
# apps/web/public/engine/pikafish-jieqi/; move ENGINE_ASSET_VERSION with this pin.
